• Inconsistent.  Sometimes it doesn't load any images at all, I close and open the menu and everything loads correctly.
• I'm using global variables to turn achievements on and off.  When achievements are off, they are black and white for now (using a separate grayscale image of the achievement icons) and when they are on they use a colored image.  This is the function for that:
Code:
Window_Achievements_Info.prototype.drawItem = function (index) {
